    R23-T2 (2026-08-07): CN_TCI.ytd (综合收益总额 本年累计) intentionally NOT generated.
    综合收益总额 = 净利润(CN_NEP) + 其他综合收益的税后净额(CN_NEPOIAT). CN_NEPOIAT's own
    children are the OCI lines CN_OCINR / CN_OCIR, both `external` engine (manually entered,
    no derivable YTD), so the official base report ships NO CN_NEPOIAT.ytd. A fixed-point
    guard therefore cannot admit CN_TCI.ytd either (it references a term that will never
    exist), so it is dropped rather than emitted as a half-built expression that raises
    "Could not expand term CN_NEPOIAT.ytd" on every render. The 本年累计 column for the
    OCI / 综合收益总额 rows is left blank — symmetric with the balance-column treatment and
    with skipping CN_NEPOIAT.ytd. See design §7.2 C4-3 and R23-T2. The install-time
    self-check (_log_dangling_expressions) guards against this class of regression.
  -->

